{"version":1,"entries":[{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"let","summary":"後から値を入れ替えられる変数を、ブロックの中だけで使える形で宣言します。","examples":[{"code":"let count = 0;\ncount = count + 1;","note":"同じ名前を同じ範囲で二重に宣言するとエラーになります。"}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0001"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"const","summary":"再代入できない変数を宣言します。中身（配列やオブジェクト）の変更は可能です。","examples":[{"code":"const TAX = 0.1;\nconst list = [];\nlist.push(1);","note":"TAX = 0.2 のような再代入はエラー。list.push は中身の変更なので許されます。"}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0002"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"var","summary":"古い書き方の変数宣言です。関数の中全体で有効で、巻き上げ（hoisting）が起こるため、今は let / const を使うのが基本です。","examples":[{"code":"var a = 1;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0003"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"typeof","summary":"値の型を文字列で返す演算子です。","examples":[{"code":"typeof \"abc\"   // \"string\"\ntypeof 10      // \"number\"\ntypeof null    // \"object\"","note":"null が \"object\" になるのは昔からの仕様です。"}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0004"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"null","summary":"「値が何もない」ことを意図して表す値です。","examples":[{"code":"let user = null;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0005"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"undefined","summary":"値がまだ決まっていないことを表す値です。代入していない変数や、存在しないプロパティを読んだときに得られます。","examples":[{"code":"let x;\nconsole.log(x); // undefined","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0006"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"NaN","summary":"計算結果が数として成り立たないときの値（Not a Number）。自分自身とも等しくありません。","examples":[{"code":"Number(\"abc\");        // NaN\nNumber.isNaN(NaN); // true","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0007"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"BigInt","summary":"通常の数値では扱えない大きな整数を扱う型です。末尾に n を付けます。","examples":[{"code":"const big = 12345678901234567890n;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0008"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"Symbol","summary":"重複しない一意の値を作るための型です。オブジェクトのキーに使います。","examples":[{"code":"const id = Symbol(\"id\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0009"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"テンプレートリテラル","summary":"バッククォートで囲み、${ } で式を文字列の中に埋め込める文字列です。複数行も書けます。","examples":[{"code":"const name = \"太郎\";\nconsole.log(`こんにちは、${name}さん`);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0010"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"分割代入","summary":"配列やオブジェクトから、必要な値を取り出して変数に一度に入れる書き方です。","examples":[{"code":"const { a, b } = { a: 1, b: 2 };\nconst [x, y] = [10, 20];","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0011"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"スプレッド構文","summary":"... を使って配列やオブジェクトの中身を展開します。コピーや結合に便利です。","examples":[{"code":"const a = [1, 2];\nconst b = [...a, 3]; // [1,2,3]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0012"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"残余引数","summary":"関数の引数のうち余った分を、配列としてまとめて受け取ります。","examples":[{"code":"function sum(...nums) {\n  return nums.reduce((s, n) => s + n, 0);\n}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0013"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"オプショナルチェーン","summary":"?. で、途中が null / undefined なら例外を出さずに undefined を返します。","examples":[{"code":"const city = user?.address?.city;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0014"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"Null合体演算子","summary":"?? は、左側が null か undefined のときだけ右側を使います。0 や空文字は残せます。","examples":[{"code":"const n = input ?? 10;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0015"},{"lang":"js","category":"変数と型","term":"論理代入演算子","summary":"||=、&&=、??= で、条件に応じて代入をまとめて書けます。","examples":[{"code":"opts.size ??= 12;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0016"},{"lang":"js","category":"演算子","term":"===（厳密等価）","summary":"型も含めて等しいか比べます。普段はこちらを使います。","examples":[{"code":"1 === \"1\"; // false\n1 == \"1\";  // true","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0017"},{"lang":"js","category":"演算子","term":"三項演算子","summary":"条件 ? 真の値 : 偽の値 の形で、短く分岐を書きます。","examples":[{"code":"const label = age >= 18 ? \"成人\" : \"未成年\";","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0018"},{"lang":"js","category":"演算子","term":"**（べき乗）","summary":"左の数を右の数だけ掛けます。","examples":[{"code":"2 ** 10; // 1024","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0019"},{"lang":"js","category":"演算子","term":"in","summary":"オブジェクトにそのプロパティがあるかを調べます。","examples":[{"code":"\"a\" in { a: 1 }; // true","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0020"},{"lang":"js","category":"演算子","term":"instanceof","summary":"値が、あるクラスから作られたものかを調べます。","examples":[{"code":"[] instanceof Array; // true","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0021"},{"lang":"js","category":"演算子","term":"delete","summary":"オブジェクトからプロパティを取り除きます。","examples":[{"code":"delete obj.temp;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0022"},{"lang":"js","category":"演算子","term":"void","summary":"式を評価して常に undefined を返します。","examples":[{"code":"void 0; // undefined","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0023"},{"lang":"js","category":"制御構文","term":"if","summary":"条件が真のときだけ処理を実行します。else if / else で枝分かれできます。","examples":[{"code":"if (score >= 80) {\n  console.log(\"合格\");\n} else {\n  console.log(\"不合格\");\n}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0024"},{"lang":"js","category":"制御構文","term":"switch","summary":"ひとつの値に応じて処理を選びます。break を忘れると下へ続けて実行されます。","examples":[{"code":"switch (day) {\n  case 0: name = \"日\"; break;\n  default: name = \"他\";\n}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0025"},{"lang":"js","category":"制御構文","term":"for","summary":"回数を決めて繰り返します。","examples":[{"code":"for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n  console.log(i);\n}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0026"},{"lang":"js","category":"制御構文","term":"for...of","summary":"配列など反復可能なものから、値を順に取り出します。","examples":[{"code":"for (const v of [1, 2, 3]) console.log(v);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0027"},{"lang":"js","category":"制御構文","term":"for...in","summary":"オブジェクトのキーを順に取り出します。配列には for...of を使うのが無難です。","examples":[{"code":"for (const k in { a: 1, b: 2 }) console.log(k);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0028"},{"lang":"js","category":"制御構文","term":"while","summary":"条件が真の間、繰り返します。","examples":[{"code":"let n = 3;\nwhile (n > 0) n--;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0029"},{"lang":"js","category":"制御構文","term":"do...while","summary":"先に1回実行してから条件を確かめます。","examples":[{"code":"let i = 0;\ndo { i++; } while (i < 3);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0030"},{"lang":"js","category":"制御構文","term":"break / continue","summary":"break はループを抜け、continue は今回分を飛ばして次へ進みます。","examples":[{"code":"for (const n of [1,2,3,4]) {\n  if (n === 2) continue;\n  if (n === 4) break;\n}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0031"},{"lang":"js","category":"制御構文","term":"ラベル付き文","summary":"外側のループに名前を付け、内側から break / continue で指定します。","examples":[{"code":"outer: for (...) { for (...) { break outer; } }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0032"},{"lang":"js","category":"制御構文","term":"try...catch...finally","summary":"例外を捕まえて処理します。finally は成功しても失敗しても最後に実行されます。","examples":[{"code":"try {\n  JSON.parse(\"{\");\n} catch (e) {\n  console.error(e.message);\n} finally {\n  console.log(\"終わり\");\n}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0033"},{"lang":"js","category":"制御構文","term":"throw","summary":"自分で例外を発生させます。","examples":[{"code":"throw new Error(\"入力が不正です\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0034"},{"lang":"js","category":"関数","term":"関数宣言","summary":"function キーワードで名前付きの関数を定義します。巻き上げられるので定義より前でも呼べます。","examples":[{"code":"function add(a, b) { return a + b; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0035"},{"lang":"js","category":"関数","term":"アロー関数","summary":"=> を使った短い関数の書き方です。this を外側から引き継ぎます。","examples":[{"code":"const add = (a, b) => a + b;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0036"},{"lang":"js","category":"関数","term":"デフォルト引数","summary":"引数が省略されたときの初期値を決めます。","examples":[{"code":"function hello(name = \"ゲスト\") { return \"こんにちは\" + name; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0037"},{"lang":"js","category":"関数","term":"即時実行関数式（IIFE）","summary":"定義してすぐ実行する関数です。変数を外に漏らしたくないときに使います。","examples":[{"code":"(() => { const x = 1; })();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0038"},{"lang":"js","category":"関数","term":"クロージャ","summary":"関数が、自分が作られた場所の変数を覚えたまま使い続ける仕組みです。","examples":[{"code":"function counter() {\n  let n = 0;\n  return () => ++n;\n}\nconst c = counter();\nc(); c(); // 2","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0039"},{"lang":"js","category":"関数","term":"高階関数","summary":"関数を引数に取る、または関数を返す関数です。map や filter が代表例です。","examples":[{"code":"[1,2,3].map(n => n * 2);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0040"},{"lang":"js","category":"関数","term":"再帰関数","summary":"自分自身を呼び出す関数です。終わりの条件を必ず用意します。","examples":[{"code":"const fact = n => n <= 1 ? 1 : n * fact(n - 1);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0041"},{"lang":"js","category":"関数","term":"ジェネレータ","summary":"function* と yield で、途中で一時停止しながら値を順に返す関数です。","examples":[{"code":"function* gen() { yield 1; yield 2; }\n[...gen()]; // [1,2]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0042"},{"lang":"js","category":"関数","term":"call / apply / bind","summary":"this を指定して関数を呼ぶ（call, apply）、または this を固定した新しい関数を作る（bind）メソッドです。","examples":[{"code":"fn.call(obj, 1, 2);\nconst f = fn.bind(obj);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0043"},{"lang":"js","category":"関数","term":"this","summary":"呼び出し方で決まる「今の持ち主」。アロー関数では外側の this を使います。","examples":[{"code":"const o = { n: 1, get() { return this.n; } };","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0044"},{"lang":"js","category":"関数","term":"arguments","summary":"通常の関数の中で、渡された引数をすべて持つ配列に似たオブジェクトです。アロー関数にはありません。","examples":[{"code":"function f() { return arguments.length; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0045"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"push / pop","summary":"末尾に追加する / 末尾から取り出す。元の配列が変わります。","examples":[{"code":"const a = [1];\na.push(2); // [1,2]\na.pop();   // 2","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0046"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"shift / unshift","summary":"先頭から取り出す / 先頭に追加します。","examples":[{"code":"a.unshift(0);\na.shift();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0047"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"map","summary":"全要素に処理をして、新しい配列を返します。","examples":[{"code":"[1,2,3].map(n => n * 10); // [10,20,30]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0048"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"filter","summary":"条件に合う要素だけを集めた新しい配列を返します。","examples":[{"code":"[1,2,3,4].filter(n => n % 2 === 0); // [2,4]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0049"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"reduce","summary":"配列を1つの値にまとめます。合計や集計に使います。","examples":[{"code":"[1,2,3].reduce((s, n) => s + n, 0); // 6","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0050"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"forEach","summary":"各要素に処理を実行します。戻り値はありません。","examples":[{"code":"[1,2].forEach(n => console.log(n));","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0051"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"find / findIndex","summary":"条件に合う最初の要素（またはその位置）を返します。","examples":[{"code":"[5,8,12].find(n => n > 6); // 8","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0052"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"some / every","summary":"1つでも合う / すべて合う、を true / false で返します。","examples":[{"code":"[1,2,3].some(n => n > 2); // true","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0053"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"includes","summary":"配列にその値が含まれるかを返します。","examples":[{"code":"[\"a\",\"b\"].includes(\"a\"); // true","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0054"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"indexOf","summary":"値の最初の位置を返します。なければ -1。","examples":[{"code":"[3,4].indexOf(4); // 1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0055"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"slice","summary":"元を変えずに、一部を取り出した新しい配列を返します。","examples":[{"code":"[1,2,3,4].slice(1, 3); // [2,3]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0056"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"splice","summary":"要素の削除・挿入を元の配列に対して行います。","examples":[{"code":"const a = [1,2,3];\na.splice(1, 1, 9); // a は [1,9,3]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0057"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"sort","summary":"並べ替えます。比較関数がないと文字列順になるので、数値は比較関数を渡します。","examples":[{"code":"[10, 2, 1].sort((a, b) => a - b);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0058"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"reverse","summary":"順番を逆にします（元の配列が変わります）。","examples":[{"code":"[1,2,3].reverse();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0059"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"concat","summary":"配列同士をつなげた新しい配列を返します。","examples":[{"code":"[1].concat([2], [3]);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0060"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"join","summary":"要素を区切り文字でつないだ文字列にします。","examples":[{"code":"[\"a\",\"b\"].join(\"-\"); // \"a-b\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0061"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"flat / flatMap","summary":"入れ子の配列を平らにします。flatMap は map のあとに flat を行います。","examples":[{"code":"[[1],[2,[3]]].flat(2); // [1,2,3]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0062"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"Array.from","summary":"配列に似たものや反復可能なものから配列を作ります。","examples":[{"code":"Array.from({ length: 3 }, (_, i) => i); // [0,1,2]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0063"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"Array.isArray","summary":"配列かどうかを調べます。","examples":[{"code":"Array.isArray([]); // true","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0064"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"at","summary":"負の数を使って後ろから要素を取れます。","examples":[{"code":"[1,2,3].at(-1); // 3","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0065"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"toSorted / toReversed","summary":"元の配列を変えずに並べ替えた（逆にした）配列を返す新しいメソッドです。","examples":[{"code":"const b = a.toSorted((x, y) => x - y);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0066"},{"lang":"js","category":"配列","term":"Object.groupBy","summary":"要素をキーごとにグループ分けしたオブジェクトを返します。新しめの環境で使えます。","examples":[{"code":"Object.groupBy([1,2,3], n => n % 2 ? \"奇\" : \"偶\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0067"},{"lang":"js","category":"文字列","term":"length","summary":"文字列の長さ。","examples":[{"code":"\"abc\".length; // 3","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0068"},{"lang":"js","category":"文字列","term":"slice（文字列）","summary":"開始〜終了位置の手前までを切り出します。","examples":[{"code":"\"abcdef\".slice(1, 3); // \"bc\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0069"},{"lang":"js","category":"文字列","term":"split","summary":"区切り文字で分けて配列にします。","examples":[{"code":"\"a,b,c\".split(\",\"); // [\"a\",\"b\",\"c\"]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0070"},{"lang":"js","category":"文字列","term":"replace / replaceAll","summary":"文字列を置き換えます。replace は最初の1つだけ、replaceAll は全部。","examples":[{"code":"\"a-b-c\".replaceAll(\"-\", \"+\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0071"},{"lang":"js","category":"文字列","term":"trim","summary":"前後の空白を取り除きます。","examples":[{"code":"\"  hi \".trim(); // \"hi\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0072"},{"lang":"js","category":"文字列","term":"includes / startsWith / endsWith","summary":"含む／先頭が／末尾が、を調べます。","examples":[{"code":"\"hello\".startsWith(\"he\"); // true","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0073"},{"lang":"js","category":"文字列","term":"toUpperCase / toLowerCase","summary":"大文字／小文字に変えます。","examples":[{"code":"\"abc\".toUpperCase();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0074"},{"lang":"js","category":"文字列","term":"padStart / padEnd","summary":"指定の長さになるまで前／後ろに文字を足します。","examples":[{"code":"\"5\".padStart(3, \"0\"); // \"005\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0075"},{"lang":"js","category":"文字列","term":"repeat","summary":"文字列を指定回数くり返します。","examples":[{"code":"\"ab\".repeat(3); // \"ababab\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0076"},{"lang":"js","category":"文字列","term":"match / matchAll","summary":"正規表現に合う部分を取り出します。","examples":[{"code":"\"a1b22\".match(/\\d+/g); // [\"1\",\"22\"]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0077"},{"lang":"js","category":"文字列","term":"localeCompare","summary":"言語ごとのルールで文字列を比較します。日本語の並べ替えに使えます。","examples":[{"code":"[\"う\",\"あ\"].sort((a, b) => a.localeCompare(b, \"ja\"));","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0078"},{"lang":"js","category":"数値と数学","term":"Number","summary":"値を数に変換します。","examples":[{"code":"Number(\"12\"); // 12","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0079"},{"lang":"js","category":"数値と数学","term":"parseInt / parseFloat","summary":"文字列の先頭から整数／小数を読み取ります。","examples":[{"code":"parseInt(\"12px\", 10); // 12","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0080"},{"lang":"js","category":"数値と数学","term":"toFixed","summary":"小数点以下の桁数をそろえた文字列にします。","examples":[{"code":"(3.14159).toFixed(2); // \"3.14\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0081"},{"lang":"js","category":"数値と数学","term":"Math.round / floor / ceil","summary":"四捨五入／切り捨て／切り上げ。","examples":[{"code":"Math.floor(3.7); // 3","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0082"},{"lang":"js","category":"数値と数学","term":"Math.max / Math.min","summary":"最大値／最小値。配列はスプレッドで渡します。","examples":[{"code":"Math.max(...[1,5,3]); // 5","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0083"},{"lang":"js","category":"数値と数学","term":"Math.random","summary":"0以上1未満の乱数を返します。","examples":[{"code":"Math.floor(Math.random() * 6) + 1;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0084"},{"lang":"js","category":"数値と数学","term":"Number.isInteger","summary":"整数かどうかを調べます。","examples":[{"code":"Number.isInteger(5); // true","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0085"},{"lang":"js","category":"数値と数学","term":"Intl.NumberFormat","summary":"言語に合わせて数値や通貨を整えて表示します。","examples":[{"code":"new Intl.NumberFormat(\"ja-JP\", { style: \"currency\", currency: \"JPY\" }).format(1234); // ￥1,234","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0086"},{"lang":"js","category":"オブジェクト","term":"オブジェクトリテラル","summary":"{ キー: 値 } で、まとまったデータを作ります。","examples":[{"code":"const user = { name: \"太郎\", age: 20 };","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0087"},{"lang":"js","category":"オブジェクト","term":"Object.keys / values / entries","summary":"キー／値／キーと値の組を配列で取り出します。","examples":[{"code":"Object.entries({ a: 1 }); // [[\"a\",1]]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0088"},{"lang":"js","category":"オブジェクト","term":"Object.assign","summary":"オブジェクトの中身を別のオブジェクトへコピーします。","examples":[{"code":"Object.assign({}, a, b);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0089"},{"lang":"js","category":"オブジェクト","term":"Object.freeze","summary":"オブジェクトを変更できないようにします。","examples":[{"code":"const o = Object.freeze({ a: 1 });","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0090"},{"lang":"js","category":"オブジェクト","term":"Object.fromEntries","summary":"キーと値の組の配列からオブジェクトを作ります。","examples":[{"code":"Object.fromEntries([[\"a\", 1]]);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0091"},{"lang":"js","category":"オブジェクト","term":"計算されたプロパティ名","summary":"[ ] の中の式の結果をキーにします。","examples":[{"code":"const k = \"x\";\nconst o = { [k]: 1 };","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0092"},{"lang":"js","category":"オブジェクト","term":"structuredClone","summary":"オブジェクトを深くコピーします（関数などは複製できません）。","examples":[{"code":"const copy = structuredClone(obj);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0093"},{"lang":"js","category":"オブジェクト","term":"JSON.stringify / parse","summary":"オブジェクトと JSON 文字列を相互に変換します。","examples":[{"code":"JSON.parse(JSON.stringify({ a: 1 }));","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0094"},{"lang":"js","category":"クラス","term":"class","summary":"オブジェクトの設計図です。constructor で初期化します。","examples":[{"code":"class Dog {\n  constructor(name) { this.name = name; }\n  bark() { return this.name + \"：ワン\"; }\n}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0095"},{"lang":"js","category":"クラス","term":"extends / super","summary":"別のクラスを引き継ぎ、親のコンストラクタやメソッドを super で呼びます。","examples":[{"code":"class Puppy extends Dog {\n  constructor(n) { super(n); }\n}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0096"},{"lang":"js","category":"クラス","term":"static","summary":"インスタンスを作らずクラス自体から呼ぶメソッドや値です。","examples":[{"code":"class M { static twice(n) { return n * 2; } }\nM.twice(3);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0097"},{"lang":"js","category":"クラス","term":"#private","summary":"# を付けるとクラスの外から触れないプライベートな項目になります。","examples":[{"code":"class A { #secret = 1; get() { return this.#secret; } }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0098"},{"lang":"js","category":"クラス","term":"getter / setter","summary":"プロパティのように読み書きできる関数です。","examples":[{"code":"class T { get full() { return \"x\"; } }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0099"},{"lang":"js","category":"非同期処理","term":"Promise","summary":"あとで成功か失敗かが決まる処理を表すオブジェクトです。","examples":[{"code":"new Promise((ok) => setTimeout(ok, 1000));","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0100"},{"lang":"js","category":"非同期処理","term":"async / await","summary":"Promise を同期処理のように読みやすく書く構文です。await は async 関数の中で使います。","examples":[{"code":"async function load() {\n  const r = await fetch(\"/api\");\n  return r.json();\n}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0101"},{"lang":"js","category":"非同期処理","term":"Promise.all","summary":"複数の Promise を同時に走らせ、すべて終わったら結果をまとめて受け取ります。1つでも失敗すると全体が失敗します。","examples":[{"code":"const [a, b] = await Promise.all([f1(), f2()]);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0102"},{"lang":"js","category":"非同期処理","term":"Promise.allSettled","summary":"成功も失敗も含め、すべて終わるまで待って結果を受け取ります。","examples":[{"code":"await Promise.allSettled([f1(), f2()]);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0103"},{"lang":"js","category":"非同期処理","term":"Promise.race","summary":"最初に終わった1つの結果を採用します。","examples":[{"code":"await Promise.race([f(), timeout()]);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0104"},{"lang":"js","category":"非同期処理","term":"setTimeout / setInterval","summary":"一定時間後に1回／一定間隔で繰り返し実行します。clearTimeout / clearInterval で止めます。","examples":[{"code":"const id = setInterval(tick, 1000);\nclearInterval(id);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0105"},{"lang":"js","category":"非同期処理","term":"fetch","summary":"HTTP 通信を行う標準の関数です。Promise を返します。","examples":[{"code":"const res = await fetch(url);\nif (!res.ok) throw new Error(res.status);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0106"},{"lang":"js","category":"非同期処理","term":"イベントループ","summary":"実行待ちの処理を順番に取り出して動かす仕組み。重い同期処理があると画面が固まります。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"js-0107"},{"lang":"js","category":"非同期処理","term":"AbortController","summary":"fetch などの処理を途中で中止するための仕組みです。","examples":[{"code":"const c = new AbortController();\nfetch(url, { signal: c.signal });\nc.abort();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0108"},{"lang":"js","category":"モジュール","term":"import / export","summary":"ファイルをまたいで関数や値を共有する ES モジュールの構文です。","examples":[{"code":"export const pi = 3.14;\nimport { pi } from \"./m.js\";","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0109"},{"lang":"js","category":"モジュール","term":"default export","summary":"ファイルの代表として1つだけ出す書き方。受け取り側で好きな名前を付けられます。","examples":[{"code":"export default function () {}\nimport f from \"./f.js\";","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0110"},{"lang":"js","category":"モジュール","term":"動的 import","summary":"必要になったときに読み込む import() です。","examples":[{"code":"const m = await import(\"./heavy.js\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0111"},{"lang":"js","category":"DOM操作","term":"document.querySelector","summary":"CSS セレクタに合う最初の要素を取得します。複数は querySelectorAll。","examples":[{"code":"const el = document.querySelector(\"#title\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0112"},{"lang":"js","category":"DOM操作","term":"textContent / innerHTML","summary":"要素の文字／HTML を読み書きします。外部入力を innerHTML に入れると危険（XSS）なので textContent を使います。","examples":[{"code":"el.textContent = \"こんにちは\";","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0113"},{"lang":"js","category":"DOM操作","term":"addEventListener","summary":"クリックなどのイベントが起きたときに実行する関数を登録します。","examples":[{"code":"btn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => alert(\"押した\"));","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0114"},{"lang":"js","category":"DOM操作","term":"createElement / append","summary":"要素を作って画面に追加します。","examples":[{"code":"const li = document.createElement(\"li\");\nli.textContent = \"項目\";\nlist.append(li);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0115"},{"lang":"js","category":"DOM操作","term":"classList","summary":"class 属性を追加・削除・切り替えします。","examples":[{"code":"el.classList.toggle(\"active\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0116"},{"lang":"js","category":"DOM操作","term":"dataset","summary":"data-* 属性を読み書きします。","examples":[{"code":"el.dataset.id = \"5\";","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0117"},{"lang":"js","category":"DOM操作","term":"イベントバブリング","summary":"子要素で起きたイベントが親へ順に伝わる性質です。stopPropagation で止められます。","examples":[{"code":"e.stopPropagation();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0118"},{"lang":"js","category":"DOM操作","term":"イベント委譲","summary":"親要素にだけリスナーを付け、子の操作をまとめて処理する手法です。","examples":[{"code":"list.addEventListener(\"click\", e => {\n  if (e.target.matches(\"li\")) { /* ... */ }\n});","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0119"},{"lang":"js","category":"DOM操作","term":"preventDefault","summary":"リンク遷移やフォーム送信など、ブラウザ標準の動作を止めます。","examples":[{"code":"form.addEventListener(\"submit\", e => e.preventDefault());","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0120"},{"lang":"js","category":"DOM操作","term":"FormData","summary":"フォームの入力内容をまとめて扱います。","examples":[{"code":"const fd = new FormData(form);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0121"},{"lang":"js","category":"DOM操作","term":"IntersectionObserver","summary":"要素が画面内に入ったかを監視します。遅延読み込みなどに使います。","examples":[{"code":"new IntersectionObserver(cb).observe(el);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0122"},{"lang":"js","category":"ブラウザAPI","term":"localStorage","summary":"ブラウザに文字列のデータを保存します。閉じても残ります。","examples":[{"code":"localStorage.setItem(\"k\", \"v\");\nlocalStorage.getItem(\"k\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0123"},{"lang":"js","category":"ブラウザAPI","term":"sessionStorage","summary":"タブを閉じると消えるデータ保存です。","examples":[{"code":"sessionStorage.setItem(\"k\", \"v\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0124"},{"lang":"js","category":"ブラウザAPI","term":"URLSearchParams","summary":"URL のクエリ文字列を扱います。","examples":[{"code":"new URLSearchParams(location.search).get(\"q\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0125"},{"lang":"js","category":"ブラウザAPI","term":"requestAnimationFrame","summary":"次の描画のタイミングで処理を呼び、なめらかなアニメーションを作ります。","examples":[{"code":"requestAnimationFrame(draw);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0126"},{"lang":"js","category":"ブラウザAPI","term":"navigator.clipboard","summary":"クリップボードへ書き込み／読み取りします（HTTPS やユーザー操作が必要）。","examples":[{"code":"await navigator.clipboard.writeText(\"コピー\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0127"},{"lang":"js","category":"ブラウザAPI","term":"Web Worker","summary":"重い処理を別スレッドで動かし、画面を固まらせません。","examples":[{"code":"const w = new Worker(\"w.js\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0128"},{"lang":"js","category":"ブラウザAPI","term":"Service Worker","summary":"通信を仲介してオフライン動作などを実現するバックグラウンドの仕組みです。","examples":[{"code":"navigator.serviceWorker.register(\"/sw.js\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0129"},{"lang":"js","category":"ブラウザAPI","term":"Canvas","summary":"JavaScript で図形や画像を描く領域です。","examples":[{"code":"const g = canvas.getContext(\"2d\");\ng.fillRect(0, 0, 50, 50);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0130"},{"lang":"js","category":"ブラウザAPI","term":"history.pushState","summary":"ページを再読み込みせずに URL と履歴を変えます。","examples":[{"code":"history.pushState({}, \"\", \"/next\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0131"},{"lang":"js","category":"デバッグ","term":"console.log","summary":"値をコンソールへ出力します。console.table で表形式にもできます。","examples":[{"code":"console.log(\"値:\", x);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0132"},{"lang":"js","category":"デバッグ","term":"debugger","summary":"実行をその場で一時停止させる文。開発者ツールが開いているときに働きます。","examples":[{"code":"debugger;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0133"},{"lang":"js","category":"デバッグ","term":"console.error / warn","summary":"エラー／警告として出力します。","examples":[{"code":"console.error(\"失敗\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0134"},{"lang":"js","category":"TypeScript","term":"型注釈","summary":"変数や引数に型を書いて、間違いを実行前に見つけます。","examples":[{"code":"let n: number = 1;\nfunction f(s: string): void {}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0135"},{"lang":"js","category":"TypeScript","term":"interface","summary":"オブジェクトの形を定義します。","examples":[{"code":"interface User { name: string; age?: number; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0136"},{"lang":"js","category":"TypeScript","term":"type（型エイリアス）","summary":"型に名前を付けます。ユニオン型なども書けます。","examples":[{"code":"type Id = string | number;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0137"},{"lang":"js","category":"TypeScript","term":"ユニオン型","summary":"「どれか」を表す型です。","examples":[{"code":"let v: string | number;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0138"},{"lang":"js","category":"TypeScript","term":"ジェネリクス","summary":"型を引数のように受け取り、再利用しやすくします。","examples":[{"code":"function first<T>(a: T[]): T { return a[0]; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0139"},{"lang":"js","category":"TypeScript","term":"enum","summary":"名前付きの定数をまとめる型です。","examples":[{"code":"enum Color { Red, Blue }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0140"},{"lang":"js","category":"TypeScript","term":"as（型アサーション）","summary":"開発者が型を断定して伝えます。間違えると実行時に問題になります。","examples":[{"code":"const el = document.getElementById(\"a\") as HTMLInputElement;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0141"},{"lang":"js","category":"TypeScript","term":"unknown / any","summary":"any は型チェックを無効にし、unknown は使う前に確認を求めます。安全なのは unknown です。","examples":[{"code":"let v: unknown;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0142"},{"lang":"js","category":"TypeScript","term":"readonly","summary":"書き換え禁止にします。","examples":[{"code":"interface P { readonly id: number; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0143"},{"lang":"js","category":"TypeScript","term":"Partial / Required / Pick / Omit","summary":"既存の型から、一部を任意にする／必須にする／選ぶ／除く、新しい型を作る組み込み型です。","examples":[{"code":"type Draft = Partial<User>;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0144"},{"lang":"js","category":"TypeScript","term":"tsconfig.json","summary":"TypeScript のコンパイル設定ファイルです。strict を有効にするのがおすすめです。","examples":[{"code":"{ \"compilerOptions\": { \"strict\": true } }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0145"},{"lang":"js","category":"Node.js","term":"npm","summary":"Node.js のパッケージ管理ツール。ライブラリの導入や公開に使います。","examples":[{"code":"npm install lodash","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0146"},{"lang":"js","category":"Node.js","term":"package.json","summary":"プロジェクトの名前、依存関係、スクリプトを書く設定ファイルです。","examples":[{"code":"{ \"scripts\": { \"start\": \"node index.js\" } }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0147"},{"lang":"js","category":"Node.js","term":"require / module.exports","summary":"従来形式（CommonJS）のモジュールの読み込み／公開です。","examples":[{"code":"const fs = require(\"fs\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0148"},{"lang":"js","category":"Node.js","term":"fs","summary":"ファイルの読み書きを行う標準モジュールです。","examples":[{"code":"const t = await fs.promises.readFile(\"a.txt\", \"utf8\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0149"},{"lang":"js","category":"Node.js","term":"process.env","summary":"環境変数を読み取ります。秘密情報をコードに直書きしないために使います。","examples":[{"code":"process.env.API_KEY","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0150"},{"lang":"js","category":"Node.js","term":"http","summary":"簡単な Web サーバーを作る標準モジュールです。","examples":[{"code":"http.createServer((q, s) => s.end(\"hi\")).listen(3000);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"js-0151"}]}